    "orange/solid_leggings.jpg"
   ]
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 3,
   "speaker": "assistant",
   "time": "2026-07-06 19:13",
   "text": "Understood — the first one's color goes on your list.",
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 4,
   "speaker": "user",
   "time": "2026-07-06 19:14",
   "text": "Same trip: Different pieces, one shared print. That print is the reason none of them worked.",
   "images": [
    "red/checkered_shorts.jpg",
    "purple/checkered_sweater.jpg",
    "yellow/checkered_shorts.jpg"
   ]
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 5,
   "speaker": "assistant",
   "time": "2026-07-06 19:15",
   "text": "The common thread is the problem. Noted.",
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 6,
   "speaker": "user",
   "time": "2026-07-06 19:16",
   "text": "Also in the bag: These two differ in every way but one: every one of them is the same cut, and that cut is my favorite.",
   "images": [
    "orange/solid_hoodie.jpg",
    "brown/striped_hoodie.jpg"
   ]
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 7,
   "speaker": "assistant",
   "time": "2026-07-06 19:17",
   "text": "Understood — the cut those two have in common is yours.",
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 8,
   "speaker": "user",
   "time": "2026-07-08 19:10",
   "text": "Big closet purge tonight. The keep pile and the donate pile are both growing.",
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 9,
   "speaker": "assistant",
   "time": "2026-07-08 19:11",
   "text": "Brutal honesty hour. What's surviving?",
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 10,
   "speaker": "user",
   "time": "2026-07-08 19:12",
   "text": "Nothing about these three matches except one print, and that's the print I love.",
   "images": [
    "blue/floral_shorts.jpg",
    "yellow/floral_long_coat.jpg",
    "blue/floral_sweater.jpg"
   ]
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 11,
   "speaker": "assistant",
   "time": "2026-07-08 19:13",
   "text": "One point of overlap, and it's the one that counts. Logged.",
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 12,
   "speaker": "user",
   "time": "2026-07-08 19:14",
   "text": "Next out of the pile: Here's the same thing twice, split only by the color — and the second one wins easily.",
   "images": [
    "orange/solid_windbreaker.jpg",
    "beige/solid_windbreaker.jpg"
   ]
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 13,
   "speaker": "assistant",
   "time": "2026-07-08 19:15",
   "text": "Clean comparison. Logging the second one's color.",
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 14,
   "speaker": "user",
   "time": "2026-07-08 19:16",
   "text": "Same sort: Two different pieces here, matched in every other way. The first one's cut is completely me.",
   "images": [
    "gray/solid_pea_coat.jpg",
    "gray/solid_leather_jacket.jpg"
   ]
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 15,
   "speaker": "assistant",
   "time": "2026-07-08 19:17",
   "text": "Everything else held equal — the first one's cut it is.",
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 16,
   "speaker": "user",
   "time": "2026-07-10 19:10",
   "text": "My aunt's birthday box arrived. Mixed results, as usual.",
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 17,
   "speaker": "assistant",
   "time": "2026-07-10 19:11",
   "text": "Aunt boxes are pure gambling. How did the wheel land?",
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 18,
   "speaker": "user",
   "time": "2026-07-10 19:12",
   "text": "Whatever else changes about these three, the cut stays — and that's the problem.",
